WEBVTT

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:14.950
Tiz.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.280
I'm begging you, Tiz,

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:19.860
please open the door! I want to talk to you.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:27.090
Thor...

00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:32.450
Tiz, there's something I have to tell you.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:34.600
Karin...

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:39.960
I'm taking Karin to Ochre Ring.

00:00:47.170 --> 00:00:49.920
You were nominated by Karin?

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:50.770
No.

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:52.900
Then why?!

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.520
Please understand, Tiz.

00:00:55.270 --> 00:00:56.320
I love you.

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:59.730
But even so, I love you as a little sister.

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:02.950
But I always loved you as...

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:09.540
Aren't I good enough?

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:12.950
I'm sorry.

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:16.830
Tiz, open the door!

00:01:17.260 --> 00:01:18.800
Tiz! Tiz!

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:52.580
<i>Zagi...</i>

00:02:54.510 --> 00:02:56.290
<i>from the day we met,</i>

00:02:57.220 --> 00:03:00.210
<i>I've watched your back, decided in my way of life...</i>

00:03:01.970 --> 00:03:04.630
<i>Must I watch that back and make a decision again now?..</i>

00:03:06.490 --> 00:03:08.010
<i>My heart is almost broken.</i>

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:20.780
Tiz.

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:23.740
What do you want to say?

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:26.820
Uh... Well,.. I...

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:28.560
I'm next, okay.

00:03:29.500 --> 00:03:32.610
I'm giving up the first time, so I'm next, okay.

00:03:36.390 --> 00:03:40.090
Next Kou no Tsuki, I'll be the one to bear your child.

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:42.090
I'm not giving it up again.

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:44.270
Tiz...

00:03:46.510 --> 00:03:47.640
What is it, Karin?

00:03:50.200 --> 00:03:51.180
Listen to me, Zagi,

00:03:52.060 --> 00:03:53.220
it's about Thor.

00:03:53.400 --> 00:03:54.890
I have to thank you, Karin.

00:03:57.030 --> 00:04:01.570
You made Thor so preoccupied he didn't even
think twice about making a decision.

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:05.150
Just what is it that you want to do with Thor?

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:09.070
You've even settled for being number 2, which is too strange.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:15.580
You've always said you want to control this planet
yourself; make it your very own playground.

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:18.620
You're going to give up the Top position to Thor?

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:20.880
Who's giving up?

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:24.340
Thor is a card in my hand.

00:04:24.470 --> 00:04:25.970
The trump card;

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:27.590
my joker.

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.850
I'm a gambler playing with cards.

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:34.520
The best card won't be played 'til the last moment.

00:04:40.370 --> 00:04:42.060
You're still the same in the end...

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:44.440
treating people like objects.

00:04:46.960 --> 00:04:50.410
You're my important card too, you know...

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:51.950
Karin.

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:54.580
No! Stop it!

00:04:55.570 --> 00:04:57.000
You already abandoned me!

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:00.790
Abandon you? Me?

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:03.250
You told me to leave!

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:08.670
Even if I said that, you still came back.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:11.760
You're cruel.

00:05:15.780 --> 00:05:17.180
I want to kill you!

00:05:23.510 --> 00:05:25.570
I really want to kill you.

00:05:31.770 --> 00:05:32.320
Tiz,

00:05:33.290 --> 00:05:37.790
are you only staying with me because
you want to have my child?

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:44.250
If I can't give you that child, will you go back to Sun Ring?

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.300
It's not like that!

00:05:52.150 --> 00:05:54.470
Tiz, please understand,

00:05:55.340 --> 00:05:58.600
I can't have a child with you. But...

00:05:59.880 --> 00:06:00.520
But?

00:06:01.620 --> 00:06:02.730
I love you.

00:06:04.290 --> 00:06:06.900
I cherish you like my own family.

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:09.110
Only in this way. I hope you can understand.

00:06:10.230 --> 00:06:10.780
Thor...

00:06:13.490 --> 00:06:14.320
I don't understand.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:20.080
If you love me, why can't you let me have your child?

00:06:21.310 --> 00:06:25.130
Having a child is the way you show
someone you love them, isn't it?

00:06:27.730 --> 00:06:32.050
Karin, go and satisfy Thor.

00:06:32.940 --> 00:06:37.100
Then report that guy's every move back to me.

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.310
What do you mean?

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:42.850
I told you Thor is my trump card, didn't I?

00:06:43.500 --> 00:06:45.940
If he starts playing a different game by himself,

00:06:46.530 --> 00:06:47.820
it'll mean trouble.

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:52.450
You don't even trust Thor.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:56.120
''Trust'' you say? How stupid!

00:06:57.230 --> 00:06:59.580
I see. Even me?

00:07:02.820 --> 00:07:04.420
Well, let me ask you,

00:07:05.110 --> 00:07:09.060
between me and Thor, whose child do you want to have?

00:07:12.480 --> 00:07:13.480
Whose?..

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:17.650
Zagi's or Thor's?.. Whose?..

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:22.400
I got you there, didn't I.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:27.240
It's fine. Go and be with Thor.

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:48.010
It's not...

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:53.890
It's not like that... I...

00:08:01.070 --> 00:08:01.860
Wait...

00:08:03.310 --> 00:08:05.190
Wait, Zagi...

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:08.360
Please, Zagi...

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:10.990
Please listen...

00:08:16.180 --> 00:08:16.870
Zagi!

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:23.050
Wait! Wait, Zagi!

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:24.420
Wait!!!

00:08:36.060 --> 00:08:36.810
Zagi!

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:43.270
Zagi, I-

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:07.050
Za...gi...

00:09:16.890 --> 00:09:24.570
Zagi... I want to bear both of your children...

00:09:27.310 --> 00:09:29.150
that's why you killed me...

00:09:31.210 --> 00:09:35.910
This is the only way you could show me how much you love me.

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:46.090
Karin!

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:49.720
Karin!!

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:51.130
Karin!!!

00:10:01.380 --> 00:10:02.400
This can't be happening!

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:09.240
Who... who did this?

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:12.570
Tell me who did this, Karin!

00:10:12.950 --> 00:10:13.750
Karin!

00:10:21.530 --> 00:10:22.850
Answer me, Karin!

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:25.640
Tell me who did this! Karin!!!

00:10:27.990 --> 00:10:29.480
<i>Wait! Zagi!</i>

00:10:31.110 --> 00:10:32.230
<i>How could...</i>

00:10:33.450 --> 00:10:34.320
Zagi?

00:10:35.440 --> 00:10:36.610
Did Zagi do this?

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:39.490
Karin, is that right?! Karin!

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:41.850
Hey!

00:10:42.090 --> 00:10:43.760
Thor! Stop this!!!

00:10:43.760 --> 00:10:44.490
Karin!!!

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:45.560
Karin's already dead!

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:47.870
She's dead!!!

00:10:59.290 --> 00:11:00.640
Dead...

00:11:03.560 --> 00:11:04.270
Thor...

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:06.730
Why?

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:09.120
Why? Zagi?!

00:11:10.710 --> 00:11:11.360
Thor!

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.020
Thor!

00:11:21.060 --> 00:11:21.780
Zagi!

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:28.810
How could you?!!

00:11:36.760 --> 00:11:37.540
What an idiot!

00:11:37.900 --> 00:11:38.940
Are you serious?

00:11:42.040 --> 00:11:43.930
Draw your sword. I'll kill you!

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:46.210
Kill me?

00:11:46.620 --> 00:11:49.550
That right, just like you killed Karin!

00:11:56.330 --> 00:11:57.130
Thor?

00:11:57.310 --> 00:11:58.520
Hey, what's going on?

00:11:59.180 --> 00:12:01.260
I heard a commotion coming from over here!

00:12:01.590 --> 00:12:02.580
What's going on?

00:12:04.050 --> 00:12:05.000
It's...

00:12:05.170 --> 00:12:06.040
Hey, look!

00:12:06.890 --> 00:12:08.200
What are they doing?

00:12:08.300 --> 00:12:09.960
Don't tell me... a duel?!

00:12:10.880 --> 00:12:11.620
Thor!

00:12:12.970 --> 00:12:13.880
Settle down!

00:12:18.110 --> 00:12:22.260
If both Top's have drawn their swords,
this is the battle for Jyu Oh.

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:24.350
Third!

00:12:24.460 --> 00:12:25.470
What was that?!

00:12:26.310 --> 00:12:27.890
Those two are the only Tops left.

00:12:28.270 --> 00:12:29.810
The winner will be Jyu Oh!

00:12:35.740 --> 00:12:36.520
Thor?

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:48.540
<i>Watch carefully.</i>

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:52.670
<i>This is the final battle for Jyu Oh.</i>

00:13:22.760 --> 00:13:24.160
Why is this happening?

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:27.870
He's doing it for Karin's sake.

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:45.760
This is bad!

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:50.260
Zagi will definitely use another sword.

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:52.480
Another sword?

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:56.060
That guy has another sword concealed on his arm.

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:58.190
That's why Yuuki...

00:13:58.390 --> 00:13:59.610
No way...

00:14:03.840 --> 00:14:04.700
Thor!

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:15.250
What?!

00:14:43.150 --> 00:14:44.820
You really did it.

00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:49.320
Zagi, why?

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:52.030
Why did you kill Karin?

00:14:55.190 --> 00:14:56.580
Answer me, Zagi!

00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:02.880
I see... She's dead, huh?

00:15:05.440 --> 00:15:07.700
So that's how it is...

00:15:07.780 --> 00:15:13.060
I forgot... you're still a kid, aren't you.

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:16.600
Zagi...

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:22.570
To kill the woman that I love, just because she left me...

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.820
do you think I'm that despicable?

00:15:24.910 --> 00:15:26.320
Then it wasn't you?!

00:15:27.670 --> 00:15:31.540
Come. I'll tell you who killed her.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:38.270
It's dangerous! Don't get close to him!

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:39.370
Thor!

00:15:43.140 --> 00:15:45.920
Tell me. Who was it?

00:15:46.410 --> 00:15:47.590
Who killed Karin?

00:15:56.840 --> 00:15:59.850
It suits you, Jyu Oh...

00:16:01.720 --> 00:16:02.650
Zagi!

00:16:07.620 --> 00:16:10.860
That guy, don't trust him...

00:16:11.870 --> 00:16:13.070
that guy...

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:18.330
Zagi, what do you mean?

00:16:18.860 --> 00:16:20.500
Zagi! Zagi!

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:22.960
Jyu Oh!

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:25.250
A new Jyu Oh is born!

00:16:26.230 --> 00:16:28.010
The new Jyu Oh!

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:50.110
<i>That guy, don't trust him...</i>

00:16:51.780 --> 00:16:53.030
<i>that guy...</i>

00:16:56.590 --> 00:16:57.330
Thor,

00:16:59.840 --> 00:17:00.830
good job!

00:17:02.410 --> 00:17:03.670
Deal the final blow.

00:17:05.220 --> 00:17:05.880
Go on.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:15.470
What's wrong?

00:17:18.810 --> 00:17:20.890
Third, you...

00:17:29.690 --> 00:17:31.030
Dagger Pagoda?!

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:32.900
What's that light?

00:17:33.460 --> 00:17:36.570
It came... to pick up Jyu Oh.

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:39.950
Now, Thor!

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:41.950
Let's go to Dagger Pagoda!

00:17:42.520 --> 00:17:44.420
Get up there and go to Hecate!

00:17:46.780 --> 00:17:47.540
No.

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:48.380
What?

00:17:52.200 --> 00:17:53.760
Zagi is still alive.

00:17:54.690 --> 00:17:58.260
And anyway, I can't leave Karin like that.

00:17:58.630 --> 00:18:00.890
Thor, this is your only chance!

00:18:01.460 --> 00:18:04.140
All the answers you are looking for are there!

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:06.200
But I don't know...

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:10.820
Zagi said he didn't do it.

00:18:11.740 --> 00:18:14.240
If that's the case, I made a mistake.

00:18:15.440 --> 00:18:16.700
So I don't know anymore...

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:24.960
Chen, please,

00:18:25.480 --> 00:18:26.540
take care of Zagi.

00:18:26.580 --> 00:18:29.200
What are you talking about?! That guy is Yuuki's enemy!

00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:30.130
Please!

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:32.710
Do it for Thor.

00:18:36.460 --> 00:18:37.510
I understand.

00:18:39.140 --> 00:18:41.600
If we don't act now, Thor won't become Jyu Oh.

00:18:42.410 --> 00:18:44.430
Until we return, keep Zagi alive.

00:18:44.830 --> 00:18:44.840
Preserve Karin's body as well.

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:50.780
Chen, I'll definitely come back.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:55.650
Until then I'll leave everything to you.

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:56.880
Ok.

00:18:58.840 --> 00:19:01.200
Third, could you give me a minute.

00:19:02.120 --> 00:19:03.950
I want to see Karin's face one more time.

00:19:06.160 --> 00:19:07.290
You've got 5 minutes.

00:19:28.960 --> 00:19:35.150
I don't know anymore... which are lies, which is truth...

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:41.410
The only thing I know is certain is these closed eyes,

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:43.200
this coldness...

00:19:44.440 --> 00:19:45.620
that's all.

00:19:48.450 --> 00:19:50.540
Tell me, Karin.

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:54.420
Who was it that killed you?

00:20:17.450 --> 00:20:18.360
Thor Klein,

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:24.530
the federation committee has accepted you as the 38th Jyu Oh.

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:26.870
Take the elevator.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.790
The shuttle to Hecate is waiting.

00:20:29.770 --> 00:20:30.920
Right, let's go.

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:33.380
Tiz.

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:01.950
You must be Klein.

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.370
Welcome, Jyu Oh.
